<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - EMERSON ELECTRIC RAISED.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - EMERSON ELECTRIC RAISED.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brown Brothers said analyst Craig Fanning raised his near-term rating on Emerson Electric Co to buy from hold.</p>
<p>-- Kept long-term rating at outperform.</p>
<p>-- Additional details not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 3/8 to 60.</p>
</text>
